    "notes": "brace-expansion quadratic-time `{a},b}` rewrite CPU DoS. Only copy is node_modules/npm/node_modules/brace-expansion (5.0.9), inside the npm CLI's bundled dependency tree (pulled in by semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm, overridden to 11.21.0). Bundled deps are frozen in npm's published tarball and cannot be reached by `overrides`. Release-time tooling only, never reachable from compiler or runtime code. Remove once npm bundles brace-expansion >5.0.11.",
